+# Missing inputs remain TODOs
+
+Existing B129 / PD01–PD04 / FAA01–FAA04 and the unchanged eighteen-requirement plan govern. This supplement adds locators, not replacement master IDs. No request was sent.
+
+1. **1239 military and Washington entries:** original form, preparation/entry history, time convention, source/counterpart recordings and completed-call/receipt logs. Establish flight and content separately for each row before joining to later Huntress dialogue. A contemporaneous or later reconstruction could change the evidentiary weight.
+2. **Controller statement versions:** original leaves, dated submission/receipt, any retained counterparts and actual preparer instructions/SISO joins. Determine the purpose of the circled5/1/02 annotation and the repeated203/204 leaves without presuming improper editing or two witnesses.
+3. **DAL2433 / DAL2437:** source R42/radio audio, strips, handoffs and native version records. Preserve both readings and test whether they concern different aircraft or one reported event. Do not tune a transcription toward either preferred value.
+4. **Primary-target and visual-report joins:** source R42/RA42/sector56/counterpart recordings and radar/track records; distinguish labels, altitude/display data, relay and identification. No source audio or independent clock/trajectory test has been performed in this unit.
+5. **Remaining packet reading:** this unit read191–206;206 begins another statement and its continuation remains unread. No whole237-page or whole-personnel-section claim. Existing completed reading remains completed, not counted again.
+6. **FAA correction/disposition:** actual May2003 draft/edit/approval/knowledge chain, corrected answer and outgoing/recipient receipt; signed consideration/action/no-action/reasons; distinct recommendation responses, implementation and closure. The2001 operational forms do not substitute for these later outcomes.
+7. **Other goal tracks:** native telephone carrier/operator and exhibit joins; recorder custody/configuration/paired decoding/clock inputs; materials specimen/native calibration joins; steel preservation/transfer/attribution decisions. Preserve current technical-owner results and independent audit limits; no duplicate tests or claimed acceptance.
+
+Recorded, received, acted upon, corrected, investigated, closed, implemented and adjudicated are different outcomes. No missing input is classified as never created, withheld, destroyed or evidence of motive solely because this review has not acquired it.
